Study about responsive hirst drawing

TODO: Convert 1 pixel to 1 unit canvas ?

setwoldcoordiantes use canvas unit
screen.setworldcoordinates(-150, -200, 150, 200) 

setpos and goto -> use logical unit (canvas unit)

screensize -> return drawable canvas area inside a window in pixel unit
screen.screensize(300, 400)

window_width(), window_height() return dimensions of the turtle graphics window in pixel unit.
screen.setup -> change the window size, calculated in pixel unit.
screen.setup(width=300, height=400)

Logical units are scaled to fit the pixel dimensions of canvas.

canvas.winfo_width() and canvas.winfo_height() -> pixel